WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.312
Okay, so how you doing

00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:08.340
I'm doing great, you know just um

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.340
Um... um

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.110
Just doing what needs to be done and

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.472
What does that mean?

00:00:15.472 --> 00:00:16.720
I'm sorry, Dad, um

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.850
Why don't we just have lunch and talk. We can do that, right?

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.560
Please

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.460
You think that you have this under control.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.199
I understand why I do things. It doesn't make me any different

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.120
You're just embarrassed because I was like, you know, I was like this amazing thing like your special creation or something

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.696
and you don't like who I am now.

00:00:35.696 --> 00:00:36.848
Yeah, who are you Nick?

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:38.700
This is me Dad here this is who I am.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.020
This is not you. This is not you Nick.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.669
What are you doing? Huh? You always got to be controlling everything all the time

00:00:45.129 --> 00:00:46.300
Let me, let me book you a room

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:46.800
No Dad.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.960
At a hotel for a couple of nights.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.529
No Dad.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.440
I didn't want it to go like this

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.600
My son has gone missing Nicholas Sheff. S-H-E-F-F.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.069
There's no one by that name sir.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.780
There are moments

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.780
That I look at him

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.870
This kid that I raised

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:13.740
Who I thought I knew inside and out and I wonder who he is.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:16.920
I thought we were close

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:20.229
I thought we were closer than most fathers and sons. Why?

00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:23.189
I felt better than ever had so I just kept doing it

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.380
This isn't us. This is not who we are

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.820
My son is out there somewhere and I don't know what he's doing.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.660
I don't know how to help him.

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:32.759
You can't.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.080
I don't feel like I have a disease. This isn't like cancer. This is my choice. I've put myself here.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.900
I failed.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.320
I can't do it alone.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:49.019
I need to find a way to fill this black hole in me.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.870
I still have a family. I want them to be proud of me.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.400
What you have you're gonna find it again, you're gonna get it back.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.800
Do you know how much I love you?

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.410
I love you more than everything.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.600
Everything?

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.020
Everything.

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:16.840
Everything.

